<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela has expanded a major military operation in the Apure plains, sending Bolivarian forces across the border to hunt irregular armed groups and destroy their logistics network. The United States is deploying drones to target Colombia’s ELN guerrilla group and a report suggests a possible US strike on ELN elements inside Venezuela. Lawmakers have opened the crisis-hit power sector to private investment, allowing firms such as Fluor to return after twenty years. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPbGxKM3R5T09iSmZXc3lMMVB5NGJ1c05VYkY4V3ZMWDJPTTIzdDBTNUpmN2VDZVpVWTJibkVjVE5xN0tmYmM3a1JUTy1sdlhCNm5TcGFaSEpiTlhIWVR0WDY3dWZsTVM0em80NFVOdnlKdGsyWDV4R2ZaZTkzSFNjUDBZZ3doYl91RW0tMjViYkw3bFdHTTE4ZW52WTY1Wk1lX3hjVHVhdGdNcVpvekVfcll3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPYzF4ZV85dk4wQmdmaGZ5UWFSajhKVXZaN0tOb3hQMFZTYTdkUDFRRWtZWVNkWGt4S0w5X0t3RzBYbWVCcEQzNjc3bFFDOGRxZkxzbE15QlVIQU02V1drbXk4Ym9UemkwNE5MWWN0VTFvdmd2RjQ5R3pjTWhUeDBtdVRGQkF2MlpFV1BzUFdyZF9BOGlhYk9Ua3IwLTBRRm9kUVFrOTBtYnNQYjh4UGow?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPcjFQM3Z1RUNQdmtuXzRvWWJWZ3NldjRJdkFQSVctQXBRSm5OR2VwTGF3aHZDRjlDU0RvUzY4d0RURk80bzZTZUpRcl9ob2I4UGVfaFRaTjZ6YUVHcUFfaU5fOV9GbWNqRHllN2NfdDJxTmoydXVlZ0JsbUdjbHN6cldJOEh0YjY5Q0VLT0NoTHNBb0FlRklnNDAwNHd6amVLYnBYanlkZ3FobjNZdkluekJoQWhadEhGNlZr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNcUI1X09sR3JkQkU4ODhvc0NPY0t2X1VzQlRLVXdmMFJldm5FX1BCOU1HR05Ta0sxUnk1TGRZbEpoNEp3WE1Ca3Y1ZHYxR1FVQThEU3EzZmxpOE94TEFsYm80cDZJd1ZFYzF0QXVNdmJsdjBhb25sYTZUbzFOYlgyb2Jsb29BQ2VqMmNfQ2VNNlNMQzV5b1ZLZndrR1plZlYyY1g5eXZv